duct": "LCD modules", "hts_code": "9013.80.90"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_acfe2dfe5bc4a121398ac7ee", "claim_ids": ["claim_a6d1d600e2c2960e8defed06", "claim_e9e37bfa6a49d2488570089a"], "query_ids": ["q_264"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_a6d1d600e2c2960e8defed06", "quote": "The applicable subheading for the Beam E-Axle Electric Drive Motor Assembly will be 8501.53.8060, HTSUS, which provides for “Electric motors…: Other AC motors, multi-phase: Of an output exceeding 75kW: Other: Other.”", "url": "https://rulings.cbp.gov/ruling/N329048", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"hts_code": "8501.53.8060"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_e9e37bfa6a49d2488570089a", "quote": "The applicable subheading for the X83F E-Axle Electric Drive Motor Assembly will be 8501.53.8040, HTSUS, which provides for “Electric motors…: Other AC motors, multi-phase: Of an output exceeding 75kW: Other: Not exceeding 373 kW.”", "url": "https://rulings.cbp.gov/ruling/N329048", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"hts_code": "8501.53.8040"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_d23e61a92f59804be710f240", "claim_ids": ["claim_6af482f7664689b333764261", "claim_f25ca1d0289a09ca61ebc75b"], "query_ids": ["q_269"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_6af482f7664689b333764261", "quote": "The company also expects power demand to surge on the back of the expansion of AI-driven data centers and predicts securing local battery supplies will become ever more critical in response to the higher tariffs on batteries from China set to take effect in 2026.", "url": "https://news.lgensol.com/company-news/press-releases/3587", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "company_disclosure", "fields": {"company": "LG Energy Solution"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_f25ca1d0289a09ca61ebc75b", "quote": "LG Energy Solution foresees an increasing need for regional renewable energy infrastructure thanks to the emerging importance of energy security. The company also expects power demand to surge on the back of the expansion of AI-driven data centers and predicts securing local battery supplies will become ever more critical in response to the higher tariffs on batteries from China set to take effect in 2026.", "url": "https://news.lgensol.com/company-news/press-releases/3587", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "company_disclosure", "fields": {"company": "LG Energy Solution", "tariff_program": "higher tariffs on batteries from China set to take effect in 2026", "effective_date": "2026"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_587ae2e9c70e14ed76e24452", "claim_ids": ["claim_0ab7863dbb7c91a2ffd43a41", "claim_d119bc054e534700289d9dc8"], "query_ids": ["q_27"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_0ab7863dbb7c91a2ffd43a41", "quote": "In anticipation of the tariffs – which include a base of 10% for all goods and 25% on imported cars – consumer sentiment continued a steep drop in March, reaching its lowest levels since November 2022", "url": "https://www.csmonitor.com/Business/2025/0408/tariffs-hyundai-auto-factory-jobs-georgia", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "tariffs", "duty_rate": "10%"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_d119bc054e534700289d9dc8", "quote": "Tariffs take effect this week, creating pricing instability across the auto industry.", "url": "https://www.facebook.com/quartznews/posts/hyundai-is-weighing-a-massive-expansion-of-its-georgia-car-plant-citing-tariffs-/1419057173423430", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Tariffs", "effective_date": "this week"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_d741336965f1db069f8af006", "claim_ids": ["claim_9a3a34bbd9eb2677ebfc8220", "claim_a9601dff52cb1decf4742cc6"], "query_ids": ["q_27"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_9a3a34bbd9eb2677ebfc8220", "quote": "Ferrel is one of 300 workers at American BOA in Cumming who make metal hoses and \"bellows\" used as sleeves in vehic